Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:04.404
&gt;&gt;&gt; FLASH FLOODS AND TORNADO
WATCHES E IN EFFECT FOR MUCH

00:00:04.404 --> 00:00:07.373
OF THE SOUTHEAST THIS MORNING,
ASEVERE WEATHER IS MOVING

00:00:07.373 --> 00:00:10.710
THROUGHOUT THE FOCUS IS REALLY
SHIFTING TO CALIFORNIA, WHERE A

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:15.014
