00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:23.556
&gt;&gt; BOTH SIDES OF THE COUNTRY.
BIG WEATHER THROUGH CAROLINAS

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:26.926
AND PARTS OF GEORGIA.
TORNADO WATCHES ARE STILL IN

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:29.529
EFFECT UNTIL 2:00.
WE HAD A LINE OF WEATHER ROLLING

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:33.867
THROUGH SAVANNAH, CHARLESTON AND
THE LIKE OVER THE NEXT COUPLE

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:36.903
HOURS.
A COUPLE TORNADO WARNINGS ON THE

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:40.673
GROUND, BUT THIS IS THE NEXT
STORM SYSTEM WE HAVE TO WATCH

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:45.011
OUT FOR, COMING INTO CALIFORNIA.
A WARM FRONT THIS MORNING, AND

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:53.019
THEN A COLD FRONT.
IT WOULD BE WET, WILD AND WINDY.

00:00:53.019 --> 00:00:56.956
THEN IF YOU GET UP IN THE
MOUNTAINS, THAT'S WHERE THE

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:59.759
WHITE IS, THIS WILL BE DEEPER
THAN A YARDSTICK.

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:02.695
WE'LL TAKE THE SNOW WHEN WE CAN
GET IT.

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:03.196
90% OF CALIFORNIA IS TILL

00:01:05.431 --> 00:01:09.869
DROUGHT, BUT WE DON'T NEED THE
WINDS, UP TO 70 MILES AN HOUR

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:16.242
THROUGH THE END OF THE WEEK.
ONE STORM TODAY, AND ANOTHER FOR

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:20.446
TOMORROW AND TOMORROW NIGHT.
I THINK IT'S TIME FOR CALIFORNIA

00:01:20.446 --> 00:01:23.816
TO SAY UNCLE FOR A WHILE.
&gt;&gt;&gt; STEPHANIE ELAM IS IN SAN

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:27.487
FRANCISCO.
WHAT'S GOING ON THERE?

00:01:27.487 --> 00:01:32.491
&gt;&gt; Reporter: WE'RE IN A BIT OF A
LULL, WHICH WE KNEW WAS GOING TO

00:01:32.491 --> 00:01:35.862
HAPPEN THIS MORNING AS WE ARE
WATCHING THE STORM COME IN.

00:01:35.862 --> 00:01:39.732
YOU CAN SEE THE WIND IS REALLY
KICKING UP.

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:43.803
WE HAVE SOME WHITECAPS ALONG
THIS PIER.

00:01:43.803 --> 00:01:47.974
THE WATER WHERE HAIM STANDING IS
STARTING TO COME THROUGH.

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:52.245
WE'RE STARTING TO SEE THIS WATER
IS STARTING TO CUP UP AND ONTO

00:01:52.245 --> 00:01:58.117
THE WALKWAY HERE IN THIS AREA BY
THE EMBARCADERO HERE IN SAN

00:01:58.117 --> 00:02:01.221
FRANCISCO.
WHAT IS ALSO NOTEWORTHY, WHEN WE

00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:05.325
GOT HERE, THIS WATER WAS ABOUT
FOUR FEET LOWER.

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:08.061
IT'S RISING, AND DEFINITE WILL
START FLOODING HERE.

00:02:08.061 --> 00:02:13.233
WHAT WE KNOW IS WE'LL SEE ROADS
GETTING WASHED OUT.

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:17.003
WE PROBABLY WILL SEE SOME
MUDSLIDES NOT JUST BECAUSE OF

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:22.809
THIS STORM, BUT BUFF THAT NEW
YEAR'S EVE STORM THE GROUNDS ARE

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:25.211
VERY SATURATED.
SO PEOPLE

00:02:25.211 --> 00:02:29.215
WATCH OUT FOR TREES FALLING
OVER.

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:32.218
&gt;&gt; ALL OF IT ADDING TOGETHER TO
MAKE AN ABSOLUTE MESS.

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:38.224
I REALLY APPRECIATE IT.
&gt;&gt;&gt; LET'S BRING IN SAN

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:40.693
FRANCISCO'S MAYOR.
AS STEPHANIE WAS SAYING, YOU

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:43.896
WENT THROUGH A BIG STORM OVER
NEW YEAR'S THAT YOU SAID THE

00:02:43.896 --> 00:02:46.399
CITY WASN'T PREPARED FOR BECAUSE
OF HOW MUCH RAIN CAME DOWN

00:02:46.399 --> 00:02:50.103
VERSUS THE PREDICTIONS.
WHAT ARE YOU PREPARING FOR NOW?

00:02:50.103 --> 00:02:53.006
&gt;&gt; WELL, JUST TO BE CLEAR, SAN
FRANCISCO, BECAUSE WE'RE

00:02:53.006 --> 00:02:56.442
EARTHQUAKE TERRITORY, WE'RE
PRETTY MUCH PREPARED FOR ANY

00:02:56.442 --> 00:02:58.444
DISASTER.
WE SPRING INTO ACTION AND WE DID

00:02:58.444 --> 00:03:02.215
THAT DURING NEW YEAR'S EVE EVEN
THOUGH PREDICTIONS AROUND THE

00:03:02.215 --> 00:03:05.151
RAINFALL WERE A LOT LOWER THAN
WHAT WE ANTICIPATED.

00:03:05.151 --> 00:03:08.855
AND IN LIGHT OF WHAT WE EXPECT
TODAY, ANYWHERE BETWEEN THREE

00:03:08.855 --> 00:03:13.960
AND FOUR INCHES OF RAIN, MAYBE
MORE, RECEIVE SANDBAGS AND CREWS

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:15.662
OUT EVERYWHERE.
WE'RE DEALING WITH TRYING TO

00:03:15.662 --> 00:03:18.631
CLEAN UP THE MESS FROM NEW
YEAR'S EVE STILL, BUT AT THE

00:03:18.631 --> 00:03:22.268
SAME TIME, CLEARING STORM
DRAINS, DOING EVERYTHING WE CAN

00:03:22.268 --> 00:03:25.371
TO MAKE SURE WE KEEP THE PEOPLE
OF THIS CITY SAFE.

00:03:25.371 --> 00:03:27.573
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY.
THERE'S GOING TO BE RAIN.

00:03:27.573 --> 00:03:30.076
THERE'S GOING TO BE WIND.
WHAT ARE YOU MOST CONCERNED

00:03:30.076 --> 00:03:32.978
ABOUT, MAJOR.
&gt;&gt; WELL, WE'RE REALLY CONCERNED,

00:03:32.978 --> 00:03:36.015
OF COURSE, ABOUT THE RAIN AND
FLOODING AND ALSO THE WIND,

00:03:36.015 --> 00:03:39.385
ESPECIALLY WHEN PEOPLE ARE OUT
MAYBE DRIVING.

00:03:39.385 --> 00:03:42.689
WE WERE TALKING ABOUT THE NEED
FOR PEOPLE TO USE 911 FOR

00:03:42.689 --> 00:03:44.690
LIFE-THREATENING EMERGENCIES
ONLY.

00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:48.361
AND MAKING SURE THAT THE CALL
VOLUME DOESN'T FLOOD AND WE'RE

00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:54.300
NOT DISTRACTED WITH THINGS THAT
COULD POTENTIALLY WAIT LIKE

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:57.403
FLOODING AND NO CONCERN ABOUT
LIFE WE WANT TO MAKE SURE THAT

00:03:57.403 --> 00:04:01.407
OUR LIFE SAFETY PERSONNEL ARE
FOCUSED ON SAVING LIVES,

00:04:01.407 --> 00:04:04.210
BECAUSE, UNFORTUNATELY, WE
EXPECT FLOODS.

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:08.281
WE EXPECT HIGH WINDS.
WE EXPECT TREES TO BE FALLING

00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:11.751
AND ELECTRICITY TO BE LOST AND
SO WE WANT TO MAKE SURE THAT WE

00:04:11.751 --> 00:04:16.322
ARE USING OUR RESOURCES
EFFICIENTLY.

00:04:16.322 --> 00:04:20.093
&gt;&gt; CALIFORNIA OFTEN WHEN WE'RE
TALKING ABOUT IT AND WEATHER,

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:22.161
WE'VE BEEN TALKING ABOUT THE
HISTORIC DROUGHT CONDITIONS THAT

00:04:22.161 --> 00:04:26.666
CALIFORNIA HAS BEEN FACING.
WHAT DOES ALL OF THIS MEAN FOR

00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:29.268
THAT, MAYOR?
&gt;&gt; WE'VE BEEN TALKING ABOUT

00:04:29.268 --> 00:04:33.072
DROUGHT AND WILDFIRES, I MEAN,
THE FACT IS, GLOBAL WARMING IS A

00:04:33.072 --> 00:04:36.542
REAL THING AND WE NEED TO --
CLIMATE CHANGE IS A REAL THING

00:04:36.542 --> 00:04:39.245
AND WE NEED TO MAKE THE KINDS OF
INVESTMENTS NECESSARY TO PREPARE

00:04:39.245 --> 00:04:44.450
FOR THINGS LIKE THIS AND SAN
FRANCISCO, WE HAVE OVER $630

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:48.554
MILLION OF WORK HAPPENING AS WE
SPEAK TO DEAL WITH STORM WATER

00:04:48.554 --> 00:04:52.058
AND CHALLENGES LIKE WHAT WE'RE
TALKING ABOUT IN NEIGHBORHOODS

00:04:52.058 --> 00:04:55.161
THAT HISTORICALLY, YOU KNOW, IN
CONDITIONS THAT ARE NOT AS

00:04:55.161 --> 00:04:58.297
SEVERE 'EVEN TODAY AND NEW
YEAR'S EVE HAVE IMPACTED

00:04:58.297 --> 00:05:00.833
SPECIFIC NEIGHBORHOODS AND SO WE
HAVE TO PEEP FOR THE FUTURE.

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:03.469
WE HAVE TO THINK ABOUT THE KINDS
OF THINGS THAT ARE GOING TO

00:05:03.469 --> 00:05:07.206
IMPACT OUR CITIES, ALL OVER THE
COUNTRY, ESPECIALLY BECAUSE

00:05:07.206 --> 00:05:10.676
CLIMATE CHANGE IS REAL AND WE
HAVE TO START TO PREPARE FOR IT

00:05:10.676 --> 00:05:11.644
AND INVEST IN OUR
INFRASTRUCTURE.

00:05:11.644 --> 00:05:16.215
&gt;&gt; YEAH, AND WE'VE BEEN TALKING.
IT'S NOT EVEN PREPARING FOR IT.

00:05:16.215 --> 00:05:18.484
IT'S HAPPENING NOW.
THERE'S VERY LITTLE PREPARATION

00:05:18.484 --> 00:05:20.753
NEEDED ANYMORE IS WHAT WE'RE
LOOKING AT WITH THE CLIMATE

00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:22.488
CRISIS.
FINALLY WHAT, IS THE MESSAGE

00:05:22.488 --> 00:05:25.591
PEOPLE IN SAN FRANCISCO TODAY AS
WE'RE IN THE MIDDLE OF THIS LULL

00:05:25.591 --> 00:05:28.795
AS STEPHANIE WAS SAYING, BUT
IT'S GOING TO BE COMING.

00:05:28.795 --> 00:05:32.698
&gt;&gt; WELL, WE'RE ASKING PEOPLE IF
THEY CAN TO STAY AT HOME AND

00:05:32.698 --> 00:05:35.034
WORK FROM HOME, ESPECIALLY IN
THE EVENING TIME.

00:05:35.034 --> 00:05:38.671
WE EXPECT THIS STORM TO REALLY
START TO PICK UP IN THE

00:05:38.671 --> 00:05:41.040
AFTERNOON.
WIND GUSTS ARE GOING TO BE VERY

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:43.709
CHALLENGING.
WE WANT FOLKS TO BE AS SAFE AS

00:05:43.709 --> 00:05:47.814
POSSIBLE.
IF YOU SEE LARGE PUDDLES OF

00:05:47.814 --> 00:05:51.117
WATER DON'T DRIVE INTO THEM.
YOU KNOW, BACK UP AND GET OUT OF

00:05:51.117 --> 00:05:53.753
THE WAY.
WE DON'T WANT TO HAVE TO COME

00:05:53.753 --> 00:05:56.989
AND SAVE FOLKS WHO ARE BASICALLY
DRIVING INTO SITUATIONS THAT

00:05:56.989 --> 00:06:00.293
THEY'RE UNFAMILIAR WITH.
WE WANT TO MAKE SURE 911 IS USED

00:06:00.293 --> 00:06:04.297
FOR LIFE AND DEATH EMERGENCIES.
WE HAVE 311, PEOPLE CAN CALL 311

00:06:04.297 --> 00:06:10.203
FOR ALL SORTS OF THINGS, WE HAVE
CREWS READY TO GO AND PEOPLE

00:06:10.203 --> 00:06:11.437
PREPARED.
WE HAVE FOLKS OUT THERE.

00:06:11.437 --> 00:06:15.308
BE SAFE AND DO THE BEST YOU CAN,
SAN FRANCISCANS WILL GET THROUGH

00:06:15.308 --> 00:06:15.808
THIS. 

